OL,3,GNEWSAFirms fear impact of 'lengthy'
OL,4,Aregeneration works
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrustrated businesses say regeneration
OL,7,Fwork is affecting their trade, with
OL,8,Fparking restrictions and disruption
OL,9,Fcontinuing for months.
OL,11,FShop owners in Guisborough say the
OL,12,Fworks, which cover areas of Westgate
OL,13,Fand Chaloner Street, have made it
OL,14,Fharder for customers to access
OL,15,Fbusinesses and find somewhere to park.
OL,17,FOne such shopekeeper Peter Milburn said
OL,18,Fwork on the road was meant to finish in
OL,19,FAugust but there had been "issues" that
OL,20,Fhave extended it for "a couple of extra
OL,21,Fmonths".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
